== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Bats|Aggressive creature strategies#Bat}}

=== Melee ===
Lunges forward and bites the player (20 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This hits in a 1.5-meter 60-degree horizontal arc. It can use this attack every 10 seconds when 1.5 meters from a player.

