== Notes ==
* When the "''You stirred the cauldron,''" [[Events|event]] concludes, any remaining bats do '''not''' despawn. Therefore, wandering bats might still attack after the end of the event, posing danger especially for [[:Category:Tameable creatures|tamed animals]].

